Hurt — a Yapfast theme

The theme itself (theme.json, the preview pictures in previews/, icon.png,
the pictures in art/, the icons in icons/ and the sounds in sounds/) is
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Its palette, fonts and motion follow hurt.bio, with its owner's permission.

The art (art/*.png), the icon pack (icons/*.svg) and the sounds
(sounds/*.wav) were made for this theme: drawn or synthesised from
scratch by script (see the repository's tools), with no third-party
pictures, icon paths or recordings.

It ships three fonts, each under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
(https://openfontlicense.org). Their full licence texts are in fonts/:

- fonts/Geist.ttf — Geist (variable, wght 100–900)
  Copyright 2024 The Geist Project Authors (https://github.com/vercel/geist-font)
  Licence: fonts/OFL-Geist.txt

- fonts/GeistMono.ttf — Geist Mono (variable, wght 100–900)
  Copyright 2024 The Geist Project Authors (https://github.com/vercel/geist-font)
  Licence: fonts/OFL-GeistMono.txt

- fonts/HurtFraktur-Bold.ttf — Hurt Fraktur Bold, a Modified Version of
  UnifrakturCook Bold: its outlines drawn 127% larger on the same font size
  and its line box tightened, so names set at body size read as blackletter.
  Renamed, as OFL clause 3 requires (UnifrakturCook is a Reserved Font Name).
  Copyright (c) 2010, j. 'mach' wust, with Reserved Font Name UnifrakturCook.
  Copyright (c) 2009, Peter Wiegel.
  Licence: fonts/OFL-HurtFraktur.txt

Geist and Geist Mono are unmodified. No font is sold on its own.
